      "component_id": "concern_002",
      "text": "The general overtime‑pay framework requires that work beyond eight hours a day be compensated with the regular wage plus at least 25 % extra, and on holidays or rest days the premium rises to at least 30 % of the rate for the first eight hours plus the same 30 % overtime premium.",
      "evidence": [
        { "quote_id": "concern_002.s1.q1" },
