      "text": "On a regular holiday, a worker must receive his regular daily wage, but this does not apply to retail or service establishments that regularly employ fewer than ten workers; if the employee is required to work on the holiday, the employer must pay twice the regular rate, and if the holiday falls on the employee’s scheduled rest day, the holiday pay is still required as provided.",
