      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "concern_002",
      "text": "The consumer‑relevant information is the adequate instruction and warning about the product’s use and possible hazards that the manufacturer must supply on the packaging, label or accompanying documents; lacking such information is itself a basis for liability.",
