      "component_id": "concern_001",
      "text": "Wages must be paid at least once every two weeks or twice a month, meaning no more than 16 days can pass between payments, unless a force‑majeure event or circumstances beyond the employer’s control make it impossible, in which case the employer must pay immediately after the event ends.",
