      "text": "When an online retailer delivers the wrong appliance model, you may demand repair, replacement, or a refund under the consumer‑protection law, and the retailer can require the return of the incorrectly delivered item at no cost to you within a reasonable time. You should first notify the retailer of the defect and request your chosen remedy, keeping a record of the communication.",
